# ONE Library Mind

Public release authorized by Nathan Tabor on October 30, 2026: “put them all in public code repository -”.

Open index.html through the existing ONE app. The reader contains the full dossier, eight unchanged English short-book sources, 26 translation drafts, and 17 separate COLOR OF TRUTH chapter drafts. Catalog search covers 2,193 records; the language registry contains 7,918 profiles, including non-individual and unreviewed records. The 480 relationship records are downloadable.

Original delivered packages and document bytes remain unchanged in downloads/. publication.json records their hashes. Historical private/no-publication notices inside those snapshots precede the explicit public release above. Translation drafts remain unreviewed. Library source links may require the owner’s access; indexing a link does not publish the linked file contents. The release does not include unseen manuscripts or all 66,666 planned targets.

No credentials or transfer helpers are included. Public visibility does not independently grant additional content licenses.
